description
	original_author = <
		["date"] = <"2026-05-08">
		["name"] = <"Johann Keller">
		["organisation"] = <"x-tention Informationstechnologie AG">
		["email"] = <"johann.keller@x-tention.ch">
	>
	lifecycle_state = <"unmanaged">
	other_contributors = <"Sol Fustinana, University Hospital Basel, Switzerland","Olha Nikolaieva, University Hospital Basel, Switzerland","Maren Diepenbruck, University Hospital Basel, Switzerland">
	details = <
		["de"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::de]>
			purpose = <"Zur Erfassung der Antworten auf die einzelnen Items des International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS), des Gesamtsymptomscores und der separat bewerteten Lebensqualität.">
			keywords = <"I-PSS, IPSS, Internationaler Prostata-Symptom-Score, Prostata, Benigne Prostatahyperplasie, BPH, Untere Harnwegssymptome", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Zur Erfassung und zum Austausch der Antworten und Ergebnisse des International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS) in digitalen Systemen verwenden.

Obwohl openEHR-Archetypen unter einer offenen Lizenz frei verfügbar sind, muss die Nutzung der I-PSS-Inhalte den jeweils geltenden Bedingungen der Rechteinhaber entsprechen. Nach den aktuellen Angaben von ePROVIDE sind abgeleitete Versionen urheberrechtlich durch den Verlag Wolters Kluwer geschützt und dürfen nur mit Genehmigung des Rechteinhabers verwendet werden. Dieser Archetyp enthält übersetzte Versionen; die erforderliche Genehmigung für diese abgeleiteten bzw. übersetzten Versionen muss daher vor Nutzung oder Veröffentlichung geklärt werden.

Licensing information: https://eprovide.mapi-trust.org/instruments/international-prostate-symptom-score">
			misuse = <"Nicht zur Dokumentation prostatabezogener Symptome ausserhalb des I-PSS verwenden; hierfür einen geeigneten Symptom-Archetyp verwenden.">
		>
		["en"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::en]>
			purpose = <"To record responses to the individual International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS) items, the total symptom score, and the separate quality of life assessment.">
			keywords = <"I-PSS, IPSS, International Prostate Symptom Score, Prostate, Benign prostatic hyperplasia, BPH, Lower urinary tract symptoms", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Use to record and exchange International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS) responses and results in digital systems.

While openEHR archetypes are freely available under an open licence, use of I-PSS content must comply with the applicable rights-holder conditions. Current ePROVIDE information states that derivative versions are copyrighted by the publisher Wolters Kluwer and require permission from the copyright holder. This archetype contains translated versions; permission for these derivative or translated versions therefore needs to be confirmed before use or publication.

Licensing information: https://eprovide.mapi-trust.org/instruments/international-prostate-symptom-score">
			misuse = <"Not to be used to record prostate-related symptoms outside the I-PSS; use an appropriate symptom archetype for this purpose.">
		>
		["it"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::it]>
			purpose = <"Registrare le risposte ai singoli item dell'International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS), il punteggio totale dei sintomi e la valutazione separata della qualità di vita.">
			keywords = <"I-PSS, IPSS, International Prostate Symptom Score, Prostata, Iperplasia prostatica benigna, IPB, Sintomi delle basse vie urinarie", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Utilizzare per registrare e scambiare in sistemi digitali le risposte e i risultati dell'International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS).

Sebbene gli archetipi openEHR siano liberamente disponibili con una licenza aperta, l'uso dei contenuti I-PSS deve rispettare le condizioni applicabili dei titolari dei diritti. Secondo le informazioni attuali di ePROVIDE, le versioni derivate sono protette dal diritto d'autore dell'editore Wolters Kluwer e richiedono l'autorizzazione del titolare dei diritti. Questo archetipo contiene versioni tradotte; l'autorizzazione per tali versioni derivate o tradotte deve pertanto essere verificata prima dell'uso o della pubblicazione.

Licensing information: https://eprovide.mapi-trust.org/instruments/international-prostate-symptom-score">
			misuse = <"Non utilizzare per registrare sintomi correlati alla prostata al di fuori dell'I-PSS; utilizzare a questo scopo un archetipo appropriato per i sintomi.">
		>
		["fr"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::fr]>
			purpose = <"Enregistrer les réponses aux différents items de l'International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS), le score total des symptômes et l'évaluation distincte de la qualité de vie.">
			keywords = <"I-PSS, IPSS, Score international des symptômes prostatiques, Prostate, Hyperplasie bénigne de la prostate, HBP, Symptômes des voies urinaires basses", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Utiliser pour enregistrer et échanger dans des systèmes numériques les réponses et les résultats de l'International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS/IPSS).

Bien que les archétypes openEHR soient librement disponibles sous une licence ouverte, l'utilisation du contenu I-PSS doit respecter les conditions applicables des titulaires de droits. Selon les informations actuelles d'ePROVIDE, les versions dérivées sont protégées par le droit d'auteur de l'éditeur Wolters Kluwer et nécessitent l'autorisation du titulaire des droits. Cet archétype contient des versions traduites ; l'autorisation pour ces versions dérivées ou traduites doit donc être vérifiée avant toute utilisation ou publication.

Licensing information: https://eprovide.mapi-trust.org/instruments/international-prostate-symptom-score">
			misuse = <"Ne pas utiliser pour enregistrer des symptômes liés à la prostate en dehors de l'I-PSS ; utiliser un archétype de symptôme approprié à cette fin.">
		>
	>
	other_details = <
		["licence"] = <"This work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License. To view a copy of this license, visit http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/.">
		["custodian_organisation"] = <"openEHR Foundation">
		["references"] = <"Barry MJ, Fowler FJ Jr, O'Leary MP, Bruskewitz RC, Holtgrewe HL, Mebust WK, Cockett ATK. The American Urological Association symptom index for benign prostatic hyperplasia. Journal of Urology. 1992;148(5):1549-1557. doi:10.1016/S0022-5347(17)36966-5.

Badía X, García-Losa M, Dal-Ré R. Ten-language translation and harmonization of the International Prostate Symptom Score: developing a methodology for multinational clinical trials. European Urology. 1997;31(2):129-140. doi:10.1159/000474438.

Mapi Research Trust. International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS). ePROVIDE. Current copyright, permission and distribution information. https://eprovide.mapi-trust.org/instruments/international-prostate-symptom-score

International Prostate Symptom Score (IPSS) openEHR archetype. openEHR Clinical Knowledge Manager. Archetype ID: openEHR-EHR-OBSERVATION.ipss.v1. Referenced only for alignment of corresponding question-level at-codes; the present archetype was otherwise developed independently.">
		["current_contact"] = <"">
		["original_namespace"] = <"org.openehr">
		["original_publisher"] = <"openEHR Foundation">
		["custodian_namespace"] = <"org.openehr">
		["MD5-CAM-1.0.1"] = <"5805ec9411b03bc63844cdd436e0002b">
		["build_uid"] = <"d39107f2-ac49-40cb-8689-b9e9511b1832">
		["ip_acknowledgements"] = <"The International Prostate Symptom Score (I-PSS) is derived from the American Urological Association Symptom Index developed by Michael J. Barry and collaborators. Current permission and distribution information is provided through Mapi Research Trust/ePROVIDE. Current ePROVIDE information states that derivative versions are copyrighted by the publisher Wolters Kluwer and require permission from the copyright holder.">
	>

definition
	OBSERVATION[at0000] matches {    -- ipss_shittymeta
		data matches {
			HISTORY[at0001] matches {    -- History
				events cardinality matches {1..*; unordered} matches {
					EVENT[at0002] occurrences matches {0..*} matches {    -- Any event
						data matches {
							ITEM_TREE[at0003] matches {    -- Tree
								items cardinality matches {0..*; unordered} matches {
									CLUSTER[at9000] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- Over the past month.
										items cardinality matches {1..*; unordered} matches {
											ELEMENT[at0004] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How often have you had a sensation of not emptying your bladder completely ater you fnisih urinating?
												value matches {
													0|[local::at0005],
													1|[local::at0006],
													2|[local::at0007],
													3|[local::at0008],
													4|[local::at0009],
													5|[local::at0010]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0011] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How often have you had to urinate again less than two hours after you finished urinating?
												value matches {
													0|[local::at0005],
													1|[local::at0006],
													2|[local::at0007],
													3|[local::at0008],
													4|[local::at0009],
													5|[local::at0010]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0012] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How often have you found you stopped and started again several times when you urinated?
												value matches {
													0|[local::at0005],
													1|[local::at0006],
													2|[local::at0007],
													3|[local::at0008],
													4|[local::at0009],
													5|[local::at0010]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0013] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How difficult have you found it to postpone urination?
												value matches {
													0|[local::at0005],
													1|[local::at0006],
													2|[local::at0007],
													3|[local::at0008],
													4|[local::at0009],
													5|[local::at0010]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0014] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How often have you had a weak urinary stream?
												value matches {
													0|[local::at0005],
													1|[local::at0006],
													2|[local::at0007],
													3|[local::at0008],
													4|[local::at0009],
													5|[local::at0010]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0015] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How often have you had to push or strain to begin urination?
												value matches {
													0|[local::at0005],
													1|[local::at0006],
													2|[local::at0007],
													3|[local::at0008],
													4|[local::at0009],
													5|[local::at0010]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0016] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How many times did you most typically get up to urinate from the time you went to bed until the time you got up in the morning?
												value matches {
													0|[local::at0017],
													1|[local::at0018],
													2|[local::at0019],
													3|[local::at0020],
													4|[local::at0021],
													5|[local::at0022]
												}
											}
										}
									}
									ELEMENT[at0023] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- Total Score
										value matches {
											DV_COUNT matches {
												magnitude matches {|0..35|}
											}
										}
									}
									ELEMENT[at0024] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- If you were to spend the rest of your life with your urinary condition the way it is now, how would you feel about that?
										value matches {
											0|[local::at0025],
											1|[local::at0026],
											2|[local::at0027],
											3|[local::at0028],
											4|[local::at0029],
											5|[local::at0030],
											6|[local::at0031]
										}
									}
								}
							}
						}
					}
				}
			}
		}
		protocol matches {
			ITEM_TREE[at9001] matches {*}    -- Item tree
		}
	}

ontology
	term_definitions = <
		["de"] = <
			items = <
				["at0000"] = <
					text = <"ipss_shittymeta">
					description = <"Der Internationale Prostata-Symptom-Score (IPSS) ist ein Bewertungsinstrument zur Beurteilung des Schweregrads von Symptomen der unteren Harnwege im Zusammenhang mit einer benignen Prostatahyperplasie (BPH). Er umfasst sieben Symptomfragen und eine Frage zur Lebensqualität.">
				>
				["at0004"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft hatten Sie das Gefühl, dass Ihre Blase nach dem Wasserlassen nicht ganz entleert war?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0005"] = <
					text = <"Nie">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0006"] = <
					text = <"Seltener als in 1 von 5 Fällen (<20%)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0007"] = <
					text = <"Seltener als in der Hälfte aller Fälle">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0008"] = <
					text = <"Ungefähr in der Hälfte aller Fälle (ca. 50%)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0009"] = <
					text = <"In mehr als der Hälfte aller Fälle">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0010"] = <
					text = <"fast immer">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0011"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft mussten Sie innerhalb von 2 Stunden erneut Wasser lassen?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0012"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft mussten Sie beim Wasserlassen mehrmals aufhören und wieder neu beginnen (Harnstottern)?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0013"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft hatten Sie Schwierigkeiten, das Wasserlassen hinauszuzögern?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0014"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft hatten Sie einen schwachen Strahl beim Wasserlassen?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0015"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft mussten Sie pressen oder sich anstrengen, um mit dem Wasserlassen zu beginnen?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0016"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft sind Sie iim Durchschnitt nachts aufgestanden, um Wasser zu lassen. Massgebend ist der Zeitraum vom Zubettgehen bis zum Aufstehen am Morgen.">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0017"] = <
					text = <"Nie">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0018"] = <
					text = <"Einmal">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0019"] = <
					text = <"Zweimal">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0020"] = <
					text = <"Dreimal">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0021"] = <
					text = <"Viermal">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0022"] = <
					text = <"Fünfmal oder mehr">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0024"] = <
					text = <"Wie würden Sie sich fühlen, wenn sich Ihre jetzigen Symptome beim Wasserlassen in Ihrem weiteren Leben nicht mehr ändern würden?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0025"] = <
					text = <"ausgezeichnet">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0026"] = <
					text = <"zufrieden">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0027"] = <
					text = <"überwiegend zufrieden">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0028"] = <
					text = <"gemischt, teils zufrieden, teils unzufrieden">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0029"] = <
					text = <"überwiegend unzufrieden">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0030"] = <
					text = <"unglücklich">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0031"] = <
					text = <"sehr schlecht">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0023"] = <
					text = <"Total Score">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at9000"] = <
					text = <"Alle Angaben beziehen sich auf die letzten 4 Wochen.">
					description = <"Alle Angaben beziehen sich auf die letzten 4 Wochen.">
				>
				["at0001"] = <
					text = <"History">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
				["at0002"] = <
					text = <"Any event">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
				["at0003"] = <
					text = <"Tree">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
				["at9001"] = <
					text = <"*Item tree (en)">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
			>
		>
		["en"] = <
			items = <
				["at0000"] = <
					text = <"ipss_shittymeta">
					description = <"The International Prostate Symptom Score (IPSS) is an assessment instrument used to evaluate the severity of lower urinary tract symptoms associated with benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH). It consists of seven symptom questions and one quality of life question.">
				>
				["at0004"] = <
					text = <"How often have you had a sensation of not emptying your bladder completely ater you fnisih urinating?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0005"] = <
					text = <"Not at all">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0006"] = <
					text = <"Less than 1 time in 5">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0007"] = <
					text = <"Less than half the time">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0008"] = <
					text = <"Abou half the time">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0009"] = <
					text = <"More than half the time">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0010"] = <
					text = <"Almost always">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0011"] = <
					text = <"How often have you had to urinate again less than two hours after you finished urinating?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0012"] = <
					text = <"How often have you found you stopped and started again several times when you urinated?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0013"] = <
					text = <"How difficult have you found it to postpone urination?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0014"] = <
					text = <"How often have you had a weak urinary stream?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0015"] = <
					text = <"How often have you had to push or strain to begin urination?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0016"] = <
					text = <"How many times did you most typically get up to urinate from the time you went to bed until the time you got up in the morning?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0017"] = <
					text = <"None">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0018"] = <
					text = <"1 time">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0019"] = <
					text = <"2 times">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0020"] = <
					text = <"3 times">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0021"] = <
					text = <"4 times">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0022"] = <
					text = <"5 times or more">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0024"] = <
					text = <"If you were to spend the rest of your life with your urinary condition the way it is now, how would you feel about that?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0025"] = <
					text = <"delighted">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0026"] = <
					text = <"pleased">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0027"] = <
					text = <"mostly satisfied">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0028"] = <
					text = <"mixed, about equally satisfied and dissatisfied">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0029"] = <
					text = <"mostly dissatisfied">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0030"] = <
					text = <"unhappty">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0031"] = <
					text = <"terrible">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0023"] = <
					text = <"Total Score">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at9000"] = <
					text = <"Over the past month.">
					description = <"Over the past month.">
				>
				["at0001"] = <
					text = <"History">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
				["at0002"] = <
					text = <"Any event">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
				["at0003"] = <
					text = <"Tree">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
				["at9001"] = <
					text = <"Item tree">
					description = <"@ internal @">
				>
			>
		>
		["fr"] = <
			items = <
				["at0000"] = <
					text = <"ipss_shittymeta">
					description = <"L'International Prostate Symptom Score (IPSS) est un instrument d'évaluation utilisé pour déterminer la sévérité des symptômes des voies urinaires basses associés à l'hyperplasie bénigne de la prostate (HBP). Il comprend sept questions sur les symptômes et une question sur la qualité de vie.">
				>
				["at0004"] = <
					text = <"Avec quelle fréquence avez-vous eu la sensation que votre vessie n'était pas complètement vidée après avoir uriné?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0005"] = <
					text = <"Jamais">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0006"] = <
					text = <"Environ 1 fois sur 5 (<20%)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0007"] = <
					text = <"Environ 1 fois sur 3">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0008"] = <
					text = <"Environ 1 fois sur 2 (env. 50%)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0009"] = <
					text = <"Environ 2 fois sur 3">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0010"] = <
					text = <"Presque toujours">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0011"] = <
					text = <"Avec quelle fréquence avez-vous du uriner à nouveau moins de deux heures après avoir fini d'uriner?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0012"] = <
					text = <"Avec quelle fréquence avez-vous eu une interruption du jet d'urine, c'est-à-dire démarrage du jet puis arret, puis redémarrage?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0013"] = <
					text = <"Avec quelle fréquence avez-vous eu des difficultés à retarder le moment d'uriner?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0014"] = <
					text = <"Avec quelle fréquence avez-vous eu une diminution de la force du jet d'urine?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0015"] = <
					text = <"Avec quelle fréquence avez-vous du forcer ou pousser pour commencer à uriner?">
